1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,320
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,800
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,480
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,680
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,800
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,280
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,200
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,400
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,600
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,320
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:48,680
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:59,040
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,400
=Episode 6=

15
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,039
(The Three Sword Immortals!)

16
00:01:02,439 --> 00:01:03,759
Body Tempering Realm, Stage 1.

17
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,840
His meridians are ruined.

18
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,640
He is rather handsome.

19
00:01:18,599 --> 00:01:19,599
Let me ask you this.

20
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,120
Where is Bai Xi?

21
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:21,920
Bai Xi?

22
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:25,239
I don't know what you mean.

23
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:27,120
Bai Xi is an ancient mythical beast.

24
00:01:27,599 --> 00:01:28,959
How would I know where she is?

25
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:38,200
This is your home?

26
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,480
Yes.

27
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:40,959
Yet you still deny it.

28
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:53,200
This house reeks of that beast.

29
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,760
Yet you claim not to know.

30
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:56,920
What?

31
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:01,560
That's not all.

32
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,239
Even he

33
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:05,200
has her scent on him.

34
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,040
Young man.

35
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,319
You'd better tell us the truth.

36
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,639
Even if you are handsome,

37
00:02:12,039 --> 00:02:13,240
I won't be able to save you.

38
00:02:16,759 --> 00:02:17,960
The mighty Three Sword Immortals

39
00:02:18,479 --> 00:02:19,919
keep asking what I don't know.

40
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,319
How am I supposed to answer?

41
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:31,039
People say

42
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:33,639
you punish evil and uphold justice.

43
00:02:34,319 --> 00:02:35,280
But all I see

44
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:37,639
are thugs who invade homes

45
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:39,680
and threaten innocent lives.

46
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,919
How dare you!

47
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,000
You dare insult us?

48
00:02:43,319 --> 00:02:44,439
You're going to kill me.

49
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:46,199
Why should I be polite?

50
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,479
Then I'll grant your wish.

51
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,240
Penglai.

52
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:51,599
Use the Soul Search.

53
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:53,599
It will reveal his past.

54
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,160
(Chen Bin, Chen Qiushui's Father)

55
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:33,680
♪Once, I was a boy who set sail♪

56
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:40,840
♪My heart set on crossing
the boundless sea♪

57
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:48,360
♪A sudden storm shattered my mast♪

58
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:55,280
♪Then I found myself
stranded in the abyss♪

59
00:03:56,479 --> 00:03:56,960
(Bai.)

60
00:03:57,479 --> 00:03:57,919
(Bai.)

61
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:03,960
♪At the end of time♪

62
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,240
(Why?)

63
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:08,719
(Why can't I protect anyone?)

64
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:31,000
I never imagined this boy's past

65
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,319
would be so heartbreaking.

66
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,360
There's something suspicious about

67
00:04:36,759 --> 00:04:37,839
the identity of his so-called wife.

68
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,000
Definitely.

69
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:40,519
She could be Bai Xi.

70
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,120
Unfortunately,

71
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:43,680
even he doesn't know where she is.

72
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:45,319
Did we

73
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,160
go too far?

74
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,800
We certainly did.

75
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:52,959
The Soul Search caused
irreversible damage.

76
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,319
He still hasn't avenged his family.

77
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:55,439
He may

78
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:58,519
be left a fool
with ruined meridians for life.

79
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:01,000
Save him.

80
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,160
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 9)

81
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,079
Feeling better?

82
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:40,360
Any better?

83
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,240
What did you...?

84
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,600
It was a misunderstanding.

85
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,399
We repaired your meridians.

86
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,000
But your wounds were too severe.

87
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:55,759
Your cultivation has improved,

88
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,480
but for now,

89
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,839
we only stabilized your core.

90
00:05:59,279 --> 00:06:01,360
The sect's Alchemy Hall
would suit you well.

91
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,879
You should enter it soon.

92
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,360
Once you fully recover,

93
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:08,079
come to Sword Immortal Island
and become our disciple.

94
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:11,680
The three of us will grant you
sword intent.

95
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:13,000
Your disciple?

96
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:14,040
Yes.

97
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,480
You can train under all three.

98
00:06:17,079 --> 00:06:18,360
You must be thrilled.

99
00:06:19,759 --> 00:06:21,560
We've never taken a disciple.

100
00:06:21,839 --> 00:06:22,839
You should feel honored.

101
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:26,439
Sorry.

102
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,279
I won't take a master.

103
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,199
You...

104
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:31,319
Your family remains unavenged.

105
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:33,319
You're past the prime age
for cultivation.

106
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,079
Starting with the Sword Dao

107
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,439
is your best shortcut.

108
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:37,920
We've offered you the chance.

109
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,519
What you choose

110
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,120
is up to you.

111
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,519
We'll be waiting

112
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:53,439
on the Sword Immortal Island.

113
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:10,800
Outer disciples
who have served three years,

114
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,759
(Initiation Trial Day)
step forward.

115
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,040
Those who fail today's trial

116
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,639
must leave the sect.

117
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,480
Those are the rules.

118
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:19,959
Those who become inner disciples,

119
00:07:19,959 --> 00:07:20,680
keep working hard.

120
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,360
Those who fail,

121
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,680
once they leave the sect...

122
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,439
(Her breathing is steady and strong.)

123
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:27,639
(Looks like she absorbed
the Essence Nurturing Pill after all.)

124
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,199
(She should be able
to stay in the sect now.)

125
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:32,360
Even if he can cultivate again,

126
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:35,120
with an unranked Dao Bone and only
Stage 1 of the Body Tempering Realm,

127
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:36,439
he'll never

128
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,920
pass the trial.

129
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:39,959
He's finally getting kicked out.

130
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:41,920
Don't say that.

131
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,319
We've trained together for years.

132
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:46,560
He was once our chief Senior Brother.

133
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:47,680
Him? Chief?

134
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,199
After the trial,

135
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,639
we'll choose a new chief.

136
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:51,800
And I think

137
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:53,839
Senior Brother Lin is the only choice.

138
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:55,439
Be humble.

139
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:56,639
Stay humble.

140
00:07:57,439 --> 00:07:59,680
Outer disciples,
step forward one by one.

141
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:07,800
Outer disciple Liu Hong,
greets the Sect Master

142
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:08,720
the elders,

143
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,600
senior brothers and sisters.

144
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:12,920
Waste no time. Test him.

145
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,560
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 4
Low-grade Dao Bone)

146
00:08:27,959 --> 00:08:29,800
His cultivation is decent.

147
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:32,000
But his Dao Bone is too low-grade.

148
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:34,159
The spirit stone barely glows white.

149
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,679
This is as far as he can go.

150
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,440
Cyan, red, yellow, and black

151
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:40,200
represent a cultivator's talent.

152
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:41,320
Liu Hong.

153
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,000
Yours is white, the lowest rank.

154
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,759
You didn't even reach cyan.

155
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:45,799
I'm sorry.

156
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,039
The Heavenly Sword Sect

157
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:48,960
can no longer keep you.

158
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,679
Thank you for training me
these past three years.

159
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:53,639
I now

160
00:08:54,519 --> 00:08:54,960
bid farewell.

161
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,639
Outer disciple Li Shuai, greetings.

162
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,800
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 3
Low-grade Dao Bone)

163
00:09:16,399 --> 00:09:17,360
This one won't pass either.

164
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:18,480
This trial is brutal.

165
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:30,320
He neglected his training.

166
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:34,600
Outer disciple Zhang Xuan, greetings.

167
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:45,880
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 6
Low-grade Dao Bone)

168
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:51,919
Cyan.

169
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:52,799
Not bad.

170
00:09:53,679 --> 00:09:55,960
You are now a formal disciple.

171
00:09:56,919 --> 00:09:57,600
Thank you, Elder.

172
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:09,279
Zhang Xuan's Dao Bone is average,

173
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,799
but he trains hard.

174
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,200
Body Tempering Realm, Stage 6.

175
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,480
Among the outer disciples,

176
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:15,720
he is one of the best.

177
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:18,000
I recall when Zhao Feiyang

178
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,080
first joined our sect,

179
00:10:19,519 --> 00:10:20,600
his talent was yellow.

180
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,879
He surpassed every other disciple.

181
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,960
I wonder if

182
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:26,840
he can reclaim his former glory.

183
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,039
Sect Master.

184
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:31,000
The past cannot be reclaimed.

185
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,240
It cannot.

186
00:10:32,559 --> 00:10:34,240
It will be difficult.

187
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,120
What...

188
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,519
Why is she up there?

189
00:10:43,759 --> 00:10:45,399
Outer disciple Cuihua, greetings.

190
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,519
Her?

191
00:10:53,919 --> 00:10:55,080
Why is she even trying?

192
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,519
She won't make it.

193
00:10:59,120 --> 00:10:59,720
It changed color.

194
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,399
How did she do that?

195
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:02,279
She's amazing.

196
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,639
She's got real skill.

197
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,679
Cyan.

198
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,120
Not bad.

199
00:11:08,919 --> 00:11:09,399
Wait.

200
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:11,840
I think there's more.

201
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:21,879
What?

202
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:22,840
Red.

203
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,480
It's still changing.

204
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:26,480
How is that possible?

205
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,360
This is incredible.

206
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,559
It's glowing red.

207
00:11:31,039 --> 00:11:32,360
When I first joined the sect,

208
00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:33,639
mine was only red too.

209
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:34,840
Remember,

210
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,519
my family poured

211
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,240
countless rare treasures
into my cultivation.

212
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,600
Isn't that girl an orphan?

213
00:11:40,759 --> 00:11:41,480
How is she so gifted?

214
00:11:41,679 --> 00:11:42,279
Who knows?

215
00:11:43,399 --> 00:11:44,720
Perhaps Heaven favors her.

216
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:47,480
No.

217
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:48,960
Look.

218
00:11:49,399 --> 00:11:50,000
Still changing.

219
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:50,919
Yellow.

220
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,600
Never seen that.

221
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:52,399
It's still changing.

222
00:11:52,639 --> 00:11:54,840
How can a servant disciple
be this gifted?

223
00:11:56,039 --> 00:11:57,240
Yellow.

224
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,519
It really is yellow.

225
00:12:00,759 --> 00:12:01,919
Will the Heavenly Sword Sect

226
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:04,159
gain another young genius?

227
00:12:04,519 --> 00:12:06,240
It... It seems so.

228
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:13,799
(Zhao Feiyang.)

229
00:12:14,559 --> 00:12:15,519
(I'll show you)

230
00:12:16,039 --> 00:12:17,120
(how far this fool you scorned)

231
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:18,279
(can truly rise.)

232
00:12:29,919 --> 00:12:30,720
A heavenly omen.

233
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:31,799
What's happening?

234
00:12:32,039 --> 00:12:34,879
Even Zhao Feiyang never caused
such a scene.

235
00:12:36,679 --> 00:12:37,480
No way.

236
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:39,080
Could it be...

237
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,480
Could it really be that?

238
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,080
Look.

239
00:12:49,519 --> 00:12:50,200
Black.

240
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,000
Black.

241
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:52,879
That's incredible.

242
00:12:52,919 --> 00:12:53,960
How is this possible?

243
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:57,919
This is a once-in-an-age talent.

244
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,519
Was that caused
by that servant disciple?

245
00:13:07,759 --> 00:13:08,440
Impossible.

246
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:08,720
Right.

247
00:13:08,759 --> 00:13:09,679
Did she cause it?

248
00:13:14,639 --> 00:13:15,200
How can this be?

249
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,720
Why would it happen to her?

250
00:13:17,879 --> 00:13:19,320
She always kept a low profile.

251
00:13:19,559 --> 00:13:21,080
But she's always been
a servant disciple.

252
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:21,840
Exactly.

253
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:23,919
(That girl)

254
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,279
(has finally made it.)

255
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,759
Black, the highest rank.

256
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:30,840
Heavens!

257
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:31,679
I...

258
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,320
Am I seeing things?

259
00:13:33,519 --> 00:13:34,480
Good heavens!

260
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:35,879
It's real.

261
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:37,120
It's real.

262
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:46,039
(Body Tempering Realm, Stage 9
Divine-grade Dao Bone)

263
00:13:46,039 --> 00:13:47,559
Body Tempering Realm, Stage 9.

264
00:13:48,159 --> 00:13:48,919
How is that possible?

265
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,559
A divine-grade Dao Bone.

266
00:13:52,039 --> 00:13:52,679
No wonder.

267
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,519
Our sect finally has a true talent.

268
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:07,039
Cuihua, congratulations.

269
00:14:07,519 --> 00:14:09,759
Your future will be limitless.

270
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,200
Good heavens, Cuihua!

271
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,320
You're incredible.

272
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,000
Every cultivation art
in the Martial Arts Pavilion

273
00:14:14,200 --> 00:14:15,120
is yours to choose from.

274
00:14:15,559 --> 00:14:16,200
Really?

275
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:17,240
Of course.

276
00:14:17,639 --> 00:14:19,399
Our Treasure Vault is open to you too.

277
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,799
Whatever resources you need,

278
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:21,879
take them.

279
00:14:22,039 --> 00:14:23,000
Thank you, Elder Wang.

280
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,480
If you need any pills,

281
00:14:25,679 --> 00:14:26,960
just come to me.

282
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,759
Anything I can refine is yours.

283
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,399
Thank you, Elder Murong.

284
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:32,840
Cuihua.

285
00:14:33,639 --> 00:14:34,799
I hear you're an orphan.

286
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,360
Yes,

287
00:14:39,039 --> 00:14:40,000
Sect Master.

288
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:42,279
Will you become my adopted daughter?

289
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:46,519
What an incredible honor.

290
00:14:46,759 --> 00:14:48,440
She rose to the top overnight.

291
00:14:51,679 --> 00:14:52,480
Greetings, Father.

292
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:53,480
Please rise.

293
00:14:54,759 --> 00:14:55,279
Good.

294
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:56,679
Wonderful.

295
00:14:58,320 --> 00:14:59,759
The Sect Master adopted Cuihua.

296
00:14:59,919 --> 00:15:00,360
This...

297
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,960
Will he groom her
as the young sect master?

298
00:15:03,159 --> 00:15:03,960
Obviously.

299
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:06,039
Across the Southern Domain
of Shenwu Continent,

300
00:15:06,279 --> 00:15:07,679
perhaps not once in centuries

301
00:15:07,799 --> 00:15:09,200
has an outer disciple
shown black talent.

302
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:11,159
The Sect Master's choice is fair.

303
00:15:11,559 --> 00:15:12,799
(Darn.)

304
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:15,279
(I thought I'd be
the next chief disciple.)

305
00:15:15,559 --> 00:15:17,039
(Now I have a formidable rival.)

306
00:15:17,519 --> 00:15:20,000
Comparisons really are cruel.

307
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,679
The outer disciple trial is over.

308
00:15:23,159 --> 00:15:23,840
You are dismissed.

309
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,960
Every disciple in the sect

310
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,320
will receive five extra spirit crystals
in their monthly stipend.

311
00:15:29,279 --> 00:15:31,120
Thank you, Elder Wang.

312
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:31,919
Let's go.

313
00:15:36,399 --> 00:15:36,879
Let's go.

314
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:40,759
Wait.

315
00:15:55,399 --> 00:15:57,480
I, Zhao Feiyang,
haven't been tested yet.

316
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:04,400
♪Last night, the wild winds
broke my sword♪

317
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:07,720
♪This morn, deep mud grips my feet♪

318
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:11,240
♪I face scorn with a smile,
time and again♪

319
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:14,680
♪I dust off my old robes♪

320
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:18,120
♪I roam the Nine Provinces far and wide♪

321
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:21,320
♪To find the dream I lost♪

322
00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:24,800
♪Let the mountains rise,
let the roads stretch♪

323
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:27,000
♪There is sunshine in my heart♪

324
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,280
♪I climb the mountains on my own♪

325
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:32,680
♪I fear no rugged road♪

326
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:35,120
♪With every punch and kick,
I carve out a brighter path♪

327
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,320
♪I climb toward the clouds on my own♪

328
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:39,040
♪Why should I need anyone's pity♪

329
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,440
♪With courage in my heart♪

330
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:43,680
♪I light up every star in the sky♪

